/*==============================================================================
  SECTION 8 — IFRS 9 STAGING, SICR, EVALUATION & REPORTING
  FULL CONSOLIDATED CODE BATCH

  SOURCE COMPONENTS
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  00_setup.sas
  10_import.sas
  20_macro_ifrs9_staging.sas
  30_run_staging.sas
  2_1 Evaluation A — Bad Rate by Stage
  2_2 Evaluation B — Timeliness
  2_3 Evaluation C — Lift / Gains
