  2_5 Evaluation E — PSI
  40_reporting.sas
  50_unit_tests.sas

  IMPORTANT SOURCE NOTE
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  The uploaded 20_macro_ifrs9_staging.sas does NOT actually define the
  %IFRS9_STAGE_ASSIGN macro called by 30_run_staging.sas and 50_unit_tests.sas.

  Therefore this consolidated lesson uses the source's macro-free staging
  logic from Evaluation A as the runnable core.

  This batch covers:
      Data preparation
      Origination PD proxy
      SICR
      Stage 1 / 2 / 3
      Stage reasons
      Bad-rate evaluation
      Timeliness
      Lift/Gains
      Transition matrices
      PSI
